    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm looking at the summary report for the Phase III trials right now and I'm seeing some notes about increased nausea in the test group compared to the generics. If we push the \"superior comfort\" angle, are we going to run into trouble with the regulators? I don't want this campaign getting flagged or delayed if the side effect profile isn't as clean as we're claiming.",
